sentences.text:
10. Let the applicant- Dilip Kumar Gupta be released on bail in Complaint Case No.92 of 2018,
under Sections 406, 417, 420, 467, 468, 471, 120-B, 379, 323, 504, 506 I.P.C., registered at Police Station Mahanagar, District Lucknow on furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of magistrate/court concerned, subject to following conditions:-
(i) the applicant shall not tamper with the prosecution evidence;
(ii) the applicant shall not pressurize the prosecution witnesses;
(iii) the applicant shall appear on each and every date fixed by the trial court.

